  "title": "Chef John's Empty Mayo Jar Dressing",
  "description": "Those few tablespoons of mayonnaise left in the bottom of the jar won't go to waste when you follow Chef John's suggestion and add a few basic ingredients to make a creamy, flavorful herb salad dressing.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
